declarations.description:
Registers more icons, or replaces built-in ones. Pass Phosphor SVG files as strings.

```ts
import fire from '@phosphor-icons/core/assets/regular/fire.svg?raw';
import fireBold from '@phosphor-icons/core/assets/bold/fire-bold.svg?raw';
registerIcons({ fire: { regular: fire, bold: fireBold } });
```

Shows a toast. Creates the `ht-toaster` container on first use.

```ts
toast('Saved.');
toast({ message: 'Deleted.', tone: 'success', action: { label: 'Undo', onClick: restore } });
toast.error('That did not work.');
```
